v>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>End May 9, 2023<\/strong><\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><strong>Starts May 10, 2023<\/strong><\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\">Regular<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">11,000 THB<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">13,000 THB<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><span>ECTI\/ IEEE\/ IEICE\/ SICE\/ ICROS\/ REV Member\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color: red;\">***<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">9,900 THB<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">11,900 THB<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><span> Student<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">9,000 THB<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">10,000 THB<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><span> ECTI\/ IEEE\/ IEICE\/ SICE\/ ICROS\/ REV Student Member\u00a0<span style=\"color: red;\">***<\/span><\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">7,000 THB<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">9,000 THB<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 30%;\"><span> Accompanying Person<\/span><\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">5,000 THB<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 20%; text-align: center;\">7,000 THB<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><b>&#8220;Registration fees are non refundable and non transferable.&#8221;<br \/>&#8220;IEEE reserves the right to exclude a paper from distribution after the conference, including IEEE Xplore\u00ae Digital Library, if the paper is not presented at the conference.&#8221;<\/b><span><\/span><br \/><b>1.<\/b><span>\u00a0Each accepted paper needs at least 1 Regular or ECTI\/ IEEE\/ SICE\/ ICROS Member or ECTI\/ IEEE\/ SICE\/ ICROS Student Member or student early-bird registration; otherwise the paper cannot be included in the conference proceedings.<\/span><br \/><span>Note: ONE author registration will cover only ONE paper.<\/span><br \/><b>2.<\/b><span>\u00a0At least one author of each accepted paper MUST present paper in the conference in order for the paper to be included in the proceedings.<\/span><br \/><b>3.<\/b><span>\u00a0Student or Member of ECTI\/ IEEE\/ SICE\/ ICROS must declare a valid student or membership status e.g. a copy of Student or Member card or other membership evidences upon registration, where our registration will allow a file download of relevant membership evidences to the system.<\/span><br \/><b>4.<\/b><span>\u00a0The author(s) pays the registration fee by logging into the author account and selecting payment. The author(s) can pay for one accepted paper at a time. (Entering Camera Ready Paper Submission &amp; Author-Presenter Registration Website)<\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_blurb][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Paper RegistrationRegistration Rate (in THB) Due to the shutdown of ECTICON2023 website, the early bird registration has been extended to May 9, 2023. payment: https:\/\/payment.ecti-thailand.org Category Early Onsite Rates (pay at the conference) End May 9, 2023 Starts May 10, 2023 Regular 11,000 THB 13,000 THB ECTI\/ IEEE\/ IEICE\/ SICE\/ ICROS\/ REV Member\u00a0*** 9,900 THB [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"on","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-164","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ecticon2023.ecticon.org\/index.php?rest_route=\/wp\/v2\/pages\/164","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ecticon2023.ecticon.org\/index.php?rest_route=\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ecticon2023.ectic